From 76f7c1d75b095970a59d3c8cf6b24e5a73d19ca7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: warriors-4p <w4p@localhost>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 21:51:36 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] warriors-4p: disconnect handling (protocol 3), pause and
 skip-vote policies (build w4p-m5-1)

- 60 s countdown, host's choice (continue without / restart), common drop poll with input relay,
  session game calls (LeaveCalls / RestartCalls), host-left message, dropped pad shown unplugged
- the last frame is re-presented while waiting so the messages are visible
- SessionPolicies: any player's Start pauses on pad 0 ("Paused by Player N"), only the pauser or
  the host resumes; skip votes ("k/N want to skip") for movies (patch S1) and scenes; Esc in a
  session becomes a pause request instead of an emulator pause
- test keys: TestDrop, TestHostChoice, DisconnectTimeoutS

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
